# the same functions with folding withheld: the walk builds the test and the branch, though both sides come to one place, and the sweep finds that the branch decides nothing
# RUN: walk f1 f2 mechanisms=none
# CHECK-LABEL: code f1:Body
# CHECK-NOT: Branch
# CHECK: Return
# CHECK-LABEL: code f2:Body
# CHECK-NOT: Branch
# CHECK: Return
# PROGRAM-OF: branch-whose-sides-come-to-one-place-is-a-jump.ir
